00:30:41.165 --> 00:30:41.665
Yeah.

00:30:41.665 --> 00:30:42.070
MARK MANDEL: What's the problem?

00:30:42.070 --> 00:30:42.680
I don't understand.

00:30:42.680 --> 00:30:43.320
No problem.

00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:43.460
It's fine.

00:30:43.460 --> 00:30:43.710
FRANCESC CAMPOY: I don't know.

00:30:43.710 --> 00:30:43.910
I don't know.

00:30:43.910 --> 00:30:44.130
I don't know.

00:30:44.130 --> 00:30:44.671
I don't know.

00:30:44.671 --> 00:30:45.222
